    "text": "By April 2 order ,\n7 hours ago Little Rock, AR – (JonesboroRightNow.com) – Aug. 27, 2025 – Gov. Sarah Huckabee Sanders issued an executive order on Wednesday allocating more funding for communities affected by the severe storms and flooding in April. The order allocates $1.5 million from the Governor’s Disaster Response and Recovery Fund... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
